{"id":"613532","name":"蒜香肉馅饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613532/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面团","amount":"70g"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜苗叶","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"自己种的蒜苗。","img":"images/613532/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"摘点叶子。","img":"images/613532/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净切末。","img":"images/613532/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取肉糜。","img":"images/613532/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放蒜苗叶。","img":"images/613532/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放食盐，鸡精，食用油和生抽。","img":"images/613532/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/613532/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取面团擀成薄饼。","img":"images/613532/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放上馅料，包成馅饼。","img":"images/613532/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅，烧热。面太软，往锅里放馅饼得时候，把馅饼抻的没有形状了。但是把面皮抻薄了，味道会更好。","img":"images/613532/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两面烙至金黄色即可。","img":"images/613532/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放案板上，分成小块。","img":"images/613532/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/613532/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/613532/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"工艺这一项没有烙，就用其他吧。如果放油，算煎？ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}